{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Link tax thresholds with inflation",
        "additional_details": "When tax thresholds remain the same although inflation rises, many workers are pushed into higher tax brackets without increased purchasing power. Fiscal drag means people end up paying more tax, and we are asking the government to automatically index tax thresholds to inflation.",
        "background": "Government to automatically link tax thresholds to inflation, to restore fairness, transparency and economic justice for hard-working people. We think by freezing thresholds although inflation is rising, taxpayers are penalised for inflation which is morally wrong.",
